        },
        "body": "there seems to currently be an issue on Google where indexing of older posts has been bugged out and indexed titles are not reflecting meta tags. There was some discussion I started [in slack](https://openjs-foundation.slack.com/archives/CVAMEJ4UV/p1754500928795959), and it resurfaced when an additional page was found recently.\n\n@MattIPv4 suggested that @nodejs/web-infra getting access to the Search Console could help figure this out, and suggested that someone create an issue for this. Would that be on the table?",
